1.

Write a complete mini page structure that contains:
- one header
- one main area
- one article inside the main area
- one aside
- one footer

**ANSWER**

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Semantic Page</title>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>My Website</h1>
        <p>Welcome to my website.</p>
    </header>

    <main>
        <article>
            <h2>About Us</h2>
            <p>This is the main content of our website.</p>
        </article>

        <aside>
            <p>Related information</p>
        </aside>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>Copyright &copy; 2026 My Website</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>


